#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:5
msgid "Feature reference"
msgstr "功能参考"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:9
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`/custom-domains`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`/custom-domains`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:10
msgid ""
"Documentation projects can use their own domain name. A project may define "
"multiple domains, as well as define the *canonical domain* where all other "
"domains will redirect."
msgstr "文档项目可以使用自己的域名。一个项目可定义多个域名，并指定将所有其他域名重定向到的 *canonical domain* （规范域名）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:14
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`/reference/git-integration`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`/reference/git-integration`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:15
msgid ""
"Read the Docs integrates with |git_providers_and|. This makes your Git "
"repositories easy to import and configure automatically."
msgstr "Read the Docs 与 |git_providers_and| 集成。这使你的 Git 仓库易于导入和自动配置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:18
msgid ""
"Note that we also support other Git providers through :doc:`manual "
"configuration </guides/setup/git-repo-manual>`."
msgstr "注意，我们也支持通过 :doc:`手动配置 </guides/setup/git-repo-manual>` 使用其他 Git 提供方。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:20
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`/versions`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`/versions`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:21
msgid ""
"We support multiple versions and translations, integrated nicely into the "
"URL of your documentation. This is served at ``/en/latest/`` by default. If "
"you have only one version, or don't need translations, you can change the "
":doc:`versioning scheme </versioning-schemes>` of your project."
msgstr ""
"我们支持多版本和多语言，并将其巧妙地集成到文档的 URL 中。默认提供于 ``/en/latest/`` "
"。如果你只有一个版本，或不需要多语言，可以更改项目的 :doc:`版本控制方案 </versioning-schemes>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:27
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`/pull-requests`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`/pull-requests`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:28
msgid ""
"Your project can be configured to build and host documentation for every new"
" pull request. Previewing changes during review makes it easier to catch "
"formatting and display issues."
msgstr "可将项目配置为为每个新 Pull Request 构建并托管文档。在审查期间预览变更，能更容易发现格式和显示问题。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:31
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`/build-notifications`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`/build-notifications`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:32
msgid ""
"Build notifications can alert you when your builds fail so you can take "
"immediate action."
msgstr "构建通知可在构建失败时提醒你，以便你立即采取行动。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:34
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`/traffic-analytics`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`/traffic-analytics`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:35
msgid "Traffic analytics help you understand how your documentation is being used."
msgstr "流量分析帮助你了解文档的使用情况。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:37
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`/search-analytics`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`/search-analytics`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:38
msgid "Search analytics allow you to see what your users are searching for."
msgstr "搜索分析让你能看到用户在搜索什么。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:40
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`/user-defined-redirects`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`/user-defined-redirects`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:41
msgid ""
"Projects may define their own custom URL redirects, with advanced "
"functionality like folder redirects."
msgstr "项目可定义自己的自定义 URL 重定向，支持文件夹重定向等高级功能。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:44
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`/commercial/sharing`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`/commercial/sharing`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:45
msgid ""
"It is possible to host private and password-protected documentation on Read "
"the Docs Business."
msgstr "可以在 Read the Docs Business 上托管私有和受密码保护的文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:47
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`/reference/cdn`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`/reference/cdn`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:48
msgid ""
"Documentation projects are primarily static HTML pages along with media "
"files. This allows us to cache them with our CDN, making them *load faster* "
"for your users."
msgstr "文档项目主要是静态 HTML 页面及媒体文件。这让我们能通过 CDN 缓存它们，使你的用户*加载更快* 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:52
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`/reference/sitemaps`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`/reference/sitemaps`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:53
msgid ""
"Sitemaps are generated and hosted automatically, improving search engine "
"optimization. This helps your users find content more effectively on your "
"site."
msgstr "站点地图自动生成并托管，改善搜索引擎优化。这帮助你的用户在站点上更有效地找到内容。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:57
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`/reference/404-not-found`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`/reference/404-not-found`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:58
msgid ""
"A 404 page is served when we can't find a page on your site. We provide a "
"default 404 page, but you can also customize it."
msgstr "当你的站点上找不到页面时，会提供 404 页面。我们提供默认的 404 页面，但你也可以自定义它。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:62
msgid "⏩️ :doc:`/reference/robots`"
msgstr "⏩️ :doc:`/reference/robots`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/features.rst:63
msgid ""
"`robots.txt` files allow you to customize how your documentation is indexed "
"in search engines. We provide a default robots.txt file, but you can also "
"customize it."
msgstr "`robots.txt` 文件允许你自定义文档在搜索引擎中的索引方式。我们提供默认的 robots.txt 文件，但你也可以自定义它。"

